UID:c231f3ed3ce80b6ffee207851918@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Arts & Culture\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Are you bold enough to answer the call of the night? When shad
 ows creep across Fernbank’s Great Hall\, something sinister awakens. Thi
 s isn’t just a costume party — it’s a haunting experience. Dance ben
 eath the towering prehistoric predators to a spook-tacular live DJ set pro
 vided by AMP’d Entertainment\, with special performers and costume prize
 s that will leave you breathless. Indulge in spine-tingling cocktails\, bo
 ne-chilling brews\, and wickedly delicious small plates. Then\, venture in
 to the mysterious world of our special exhibit\, The Secret World of Eleph
 ants. Come dance with darkness and embrace the shadows within. WARNING: Th
 is nightmare is exclusively for brave souls ages 21 and over.\nCategory: A
 rts & Culture\nOriginal listing: https://www.artsatl.org/event/fright-nigh
 t/
LOCATION:Fernbank Museum\, 767 Clifton Road N.E.\, Atlanta\, Georgia\, 303
 07
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://www.artsatl.org/event/fright-night/
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-REGION:us
X-GLOBAL-CULTURE-SOURCE:artsatl
