DESCRIPTION:On November 17 and January 19\, New Orleans Museum of Art is h
 osting a Gallery Talk for Teens. The programs will take place in the museu
 m’s first floor Ella West Freeman Gallery\, where the exhibition Second 
 Nature: Japanese Rinpa Paintings from the Gitter-Yelen Collection is curre
 ntly on view . This program will include an interactive gallery activity a
 nd a question-and-answer session to encourage peer discussion. To register
  for November 17’s program\, please RSVP by October 30\, 2026. To regist
 er for January 19’s program\, please RSVP by December 10\, 2026. To RSVP
  or for questions\, contact Michelle Haysley\, NOMA’s Education Programs
  Manager\, at mhaysley@noma.org . Second Nature: Japanese Rinpa\nCategory:
